Package: scFlex
Type: Package
Title: Flexible Conversion Between Single-Cell Data Objects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mohamed N.", "Hassan", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "m.nhassan@hotmail.com")
    )
Description: Provides conversion among 'Seurat', 'SingleCellExperiment',
    'AnnData', and 'Loom' single-cell data representations while preserving
    expression matrices, cell and feature metadata, and dimensionality
    reductions when supported by the target format. The package performs
    alignment and validity checks during conversion and reports unsupported
    or unavailable components rather than silently reconstructing them.
